style pocket1_lining stick
color #1/H:72,/H:76,/H:65 magenta
color #1/H:71 forest green
color #1/H:78 gold
surface pocket1_lining
transparency pocket1_lining 70
color pocket1_lining slate gray
marker #101 position 38.116,24.111,2.017 color red radius 1.0
2dlabels text "Pocket 1 (69% druggable) *" xpos 0.02 ypos 0.95 color black size 14

